The board definition comes from Wakes (Worldwave). The ADC configuration,
measured button centers, fader range and jack-sense logic follow Wakes.
https://github.com/Worldwave/Wakes

The SP-1 codec register sequences and bring-up order come from Wakes and
sp1-tape-looper, including the Cirrus initialization from SP-1-dev and
the TI TAS2505 application guide (SLAU472C, section 5.1).
https://github.com/chattock/sp1-tape-looper
https://github.com/timknapen/SP-1-dev

The underlying SP-1 Zephyr board originated in sp1-midi.
https://github.com/ericlewis/sp1-midi

The USB MIDI 1.0 function follows the feldd descriptors and the Wakes
composite MIDI/serial configuration for the SP-1.
https://github.com/bnjreece/feldd-sp1-firmware
https://github.com/Worldwave/Wakes

